    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Kal'tsit?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Kal'tsit, we should keep moving."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "...You..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Why are you here...?! You, of all people!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Are you... trying to eradicate Reunion completely?! Rhodes Island, you're really no better..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "...Forget that for now! The Sarkaz mercenary patrol is going to pass through this warehouse soon!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "If we don't deal with them, or at least hide, they're going to find us and take us away..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Not to mention the regular Reunion patrols. We don't have much time to find supplies!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "That's why so many are starving, and short on medicine. There's a lot of death among the people of Chernobog."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Amiya, Dr. Kal'tsit! Also... Dr. {@nickname}, I really hope you can trust me. Or at least find somewhere to hide!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Guard..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Infected Ursus woman."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "Do you mean me?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Infected Ursus woman, I have some honest questions for you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "Y-your accent... you're from the capital of the Empire, aren't you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "But the way you speak, it's so old-fashioned..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You're educated."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "...I was a copyist at a university, before."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "It's all gone now, thanks to you Infected."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "All right, do you trust the man behind you? Our Infected former employee, now with Reunion?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "Huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "He's... your employee?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "One of Rhodes Island's functions is helping innocent Infected survive in a combat environment."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Whether or not you are innocent remains to be seen..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "However."
    },
