    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "The blade pressed against your throat has an incision angle of only eight degrees. Another six millimeters deeper and it severs an artery."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Miss."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "Um, err...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Did he truly work so hard to ensure your survival, as he claimed?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "What are you asking... What are you getting at?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Did he and his Reunion element, or any part thereof, threaten your life or take any action to harm you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I will deal with him in accordance with your response."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "Are you threatening me with his life?! I... we... we had nothing to do with each other!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "What about him, individually? Did he go along with Reunion and their crimes against humanity?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Doctor... Kal'tsit... I'm insulted!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I can only rely on the words of eyewitnesses and victims. Since you claim to have guaranteed her right to life, then I have only the young lady's testimony by which to adjudicate your claim."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You gave only your side of the story."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "But what she says is also\u2014"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "She's in a different position."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You have power. You can use violence. It doesn't matter what you did with that violence."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "I felt it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Amiya, it's the Sarkaz."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "The targets are getting close."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "Couldn't... but he..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Did he or did he not protect you from Reunion? Did he or did he not effectively keep you safe from their aggression?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit...! The patrol is here! It's not... it's not the guerrillas! You can't... Don't let them..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "You're not making any sense!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I am confident our actions are well within the ethical parameters of Ursus. It was you who made the accusation against him."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "He... he did go out regularly, about this time..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit! Let me... stop the Sarkaz! Or at least... let me get them to go someplace else!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I need an answer."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Speak. Or we will never know the truth."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Twenty-four meters out, in a straight line. Very close."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Twenty-two meters."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Mon3tr."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_059",
            "name2": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rhodes Island Guard?",
        "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1",
            "name2": "avg_npc_057",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "No! He didn't! He didn't do anything wrong!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Ursus Infected",
        "text": "At least... at least nothing I saw!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Amiya, Doctor."
    },
    {
        "command": "decision",
        "params": {
            "options": "Huh?;......;You put on a good show.",
            "values": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "predicate",
        "params": {
            "references": "1;2;3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Thank you for your time."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Darn it... Dr. Kal'tsit! I knew it...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Let's go, Doctor!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Amiya",
        "text": "Our next target is Reunion's Sarkaz patrol team!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_042"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "I'm coming too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "Guard, was it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "You're wrong about me. But I'll protect you. I'll get your revenge for you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Rosmontis",
        "text": "They'll pay for what they did to you, and my family, and the common people. They'll all pay, for all of it."
    },
